## 2026-11-18 — Premium P23 complete
- Magnifier per premium §7.15, §5.9. The container is `material-thick` + `shadow-popover`, `r-lg`, padding 8, 200 wide. The loupe is 184 x 112, `r-sm`, with an inner 1 px white 0.08 ring, a 1.5 px white rim (`hoverStroke.inner`) on the die, and the theme `bg` behind the disc. It shows on hover devices only (`@media (hover: none)` hides it, and a touch pin drops it). The readout is Inter only, at most 4 rows, primary and secondary text only, nothing orange but the swatch: status (10 px swatch: ember for failed, hollow `hairline-strong` for passed, `--bin-ink-N` in bin modes; "Failed"/"Passed" `row-title`; bin code), place ("X 12, Y −4" with a true minus via `formatDieCoordinate`; "Site 2"), one key test (name ellipsis at 96 px, primary value, `caption` "out of limits" line), and the retest line. The HBIN and Notch rows, the bin name, and the mono values are gone. A touch tap pins the readout 12 px above the die (flips below at the top edge, `computePinnedReadoutPlacement`, `data-pin-source="touch"`) with an opacity-only 120 ms fade. Keys: `magnifier.failed/passed/place/retestedFailed` added, `magnifier.retested` reworded, `magnifier.coords/site/bin/hbin/retestedValue/notch/notchValue` removed; 238 keys in all 5 locales.
